- assets.ts, mail.ts, wallet.ts, skills.ts, contracts.ts
- calendar.ts, clones.ts, contacts.ts, dogma.ts, faction-warfare.ts
- fittings.ts, fleet.ts, incursions.ts, industry.ts, insurance.ts
- killmails.ts, location.ts, loyalty.ts, pi.ts, sovereignty.ts
