5. **Advanced Features**: CursorOptions, WithMetadata, fetchAllCursorPages
6. **Error Handling**: EsiError, TimeoutError, type guards (isEsiError, isRateLimited, etc.)
7. **Middleware**: RequestInterceptor, ResponseInterceptor, RequestContext, ResponseContext
