**Architecture Overview**:
- **Pure TypeScript** (no JavaScript/JavaScript framework dependencies)
- **Minimal Runtime Validation** (compile-time TypeScript only)
- **Custom Infrastructure** (caching, rate limiting, circuit breaker)
- **Middleware-Based Extensibility** (request/response interceptors)
- **Generator-Based Pagination** (AsyncGenerator for streaming results)
- **Comprehensive Test Coverage** (BDD-style with Jest + Cucumber)

